# Django Notes App Deployment Automation

A Bash script that automates the deployment of a Django Notes application on an Ubuntu server using Docker, Docker Compose, and Nginx.

## 🚀 Features

- Clones the Django Notes App repository
- Installs all required dependencies
  - Docker
  - Docker Compose
  - Nginx
- Configures Docker permissions
- Enables and restarts required services
- Builds the Docker image
- Deploys the application using Docker Compose
- Includes basic error handling for each deployment step

