Performing the restart to build the django app...

Finally deploying the app...

******** DEPLOYEMENT DONE ********
```

---

## ❗ Error Handling

The script stops execution if any of the following steps fail:

- Repository cloning
- Dependency installation
- Docker configuration
- Docker image build
- Container deployment

This prevents incomplete deployments.

